      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e 3 separate virtio-block devices \n\nI am not sure where you got this. We are still using composite disks. We use two composite disks. The disk 1 is for the microdroid along with the apexes and apk that the user has chosen. It consists of partitions like boot, vbmeta, super, etc. The disk 2 is for the apexes and apk that we load to Microdroid. The second is for the bootconfig partition and the instance partition where VM\u0027s identity is stored.",
